==Battleground==
*1 [[Ritual Drum Doge]] spawns as the boss.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 8.33~10 seconds<sup>250f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn after 8.33 seconds<sup>250f</sup>, delay 8.33~10 seconds<sup>250f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 45 seconds<sup>1,350f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Festive Otter]] spawns after 76.67 seconds<sup>2,300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Festive Otter]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 53.33~66.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~2,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 23.33~26.67 seconds<sup>700f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It is recommended to bring [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]]. By spamming cheap meatshields at the beginning, you can get a good stack of Paris Cats, so once the more threatening Dark enemies spawn—specifically Shadow Boxer K—you can continuously knock them back using your Paris Stack. You'll still need to be careful, though, as Ritual Drum Doge freezes all of your units, so you've got to keep up the meatshield spam, since the freeze time allows for the Dark units to penetrate into your front lines, and potentially destroy your stack.

